OL,3,GNEWSAOld bridge emerges as dry weather
OL,4,Alowers reservoir
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn old bridge which was submerged
OL,7,Fduring the construction of a reservoir
OL,8,Fhas re-emerged due to falling water
OL,9,Flevels.
OL,11,FThe packhorse bridge at Grassholme
OL,12,Freservoir, near Middleton-in-Teesdale
OL,13,Fin County Durham, also appears
OL,14,Foccasionally when there is maintenance
OL,15,Fwork.
OL,17,FRichard Hewitt, principal at the Royal
OL,18,FYachting Association at Teesdale
OL,19,Fsailing and water sports club, said the
OL,20,Fwater had dropped 2m (6.5ft) this year.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
