OL,3,GNEWSAOld bridge emerges as dry weather
OL,4,Alowers reservoir
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Northumbrian Water
OL,7,Fsaid the dry weather had "contributed
OL,8,Fto lower reservoir levels", as well the
OL,9,Fuse of more water from Grassholme while
OL,10,Fmaintenance work took place at other
OL,11,Flocal reservoirs.
